Nuremberg (Russian: Нюрнберг) is a 2023 Russian historical drama film written
and directed by Nikolai Lebedev about the Nuremberg trials.

8
00:42:54,545 --> 00:43:00,545
The script was based on the book Forever and Eternal by Alexander Zvyagintsev.

9
00:48:16,363 --> 00:48:22,363
Nuremberg premiered at the Four Seasons Hotel Moscow in Moscow on February 20, 2023, and was theatrically
released in the Russian Federation on March 2, 2023, by National Media Group Film Distribution.

